<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-HOPMAN CUP RESULTS, DAY ONE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-HOPMAN CUP RESULTS, DAY ONE.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH, Australia 1996-12-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results on the first day of the Hopman Cup mixed teams tennis tournament on Sunday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Group A</p>
<p>1-Croatia beat Australia 2-1</p>
<p>Singles (Croatian names first)</p>
<p>Iva Majoli beat Nicole Bradtke 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Goran Ivanisevic lost to Mark Philippoussis 2-6 3-6</p>
<p>Doubles</p>
<p>Ivanisevic/Majoli beat Philippoussis/Bradtke 7-5 7-5</p>
<p>United States beat 4-France 2-1</p>
<p>Singles (U.S. names first)</p>
<p>Chanda Rubin beat Mary Pierce 6-4 6-1</p>
<p>Justin Gimelstob lost to Guy Forget 6-2 3-6 3-6</p>
<p>Doubles</p>
<p>Gimelstob/Rubin beat Forget/Pierce 3-6 6-3 6-2</p>
</text>
